core-report.ttl.text_tail:
ELECT $this WHERE {
              FILTER NOT EXISTS {
                ?event fneo:supportedBy $this .
                ?document fneo:reportsEvent ?event .
              }
            }
        ") ; sh:severity sh:Warning ]
	Message: Textual evidence should be traceable to a financial news document.

